.TH TARBALL 1 "DTar Manual"
.SH NAME
tarball \- create a tarball from a file or directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tarball
<path> [output]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a tar archive from the specified file or directory.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I path
The file or directory to archive.
.TP
.I output
(Optional) Output tarball file name.